## SQ-PS15B-01 | 20-block drops (100 hp zombies, base speed 0): plain, lone web ground, lone web 5 up, 3 stacked, 3-face web, ripe berry bush; per-tick fall watch
@group A
@commands SQ-PTH-03 rerun, same drop heights (100 hp zombies, 20-block drops, per-tick fallDistance watch): plain, lone web at ground level, lone web 5 up, 3 stacked webs, a web with webs on 3 of its 6 faces (2 sides and below), a ripe sweet berry bush
@pass lone web: fall distance 14.55 -> about 12.4 on entering, damage about x0.85; 3 stacked: about x0.61; 3-face web: fall distance 0 inside, no damage (dense reset); bush: full plain damage
@fails `PassThrough.fallResetClip` / `ownsFallReset`, `PassRule.cell` `resetFall` (dense only)
