## SQ-PS15B-02 | elevated cube: snowball from z 994.5 / 995.5 / 996.2, pearl from 995.5 (breakStallTicks 3)
@group A
@commands SQ-PTH-11 rerun from z 995.5, 994.5 and 996.2: snowball and ender pearl (bot thrower); then `breakStallTicks = 0` (restart) and the 995.5 snowball again
@pass 995.5: snowball and pearl stop in the edge web and break about 3 ticks later where they stopped; the pearl teleports the bot there and is gone; 994.5 and 996.2 as SQ-PTH-11; with 0 the edge-cell snowball hangs (no break)
@fails `PassProjectiles.stallBreaks`, `PassState.stallTicks`, `breakIn(.., false)`
@from batches/r1116/ps15b_a.qb
> fill 1090 -57 1000 1092 -55 1002 minecraft:cobweb
> fill 1091 -58 994 1091 -58 996 minecraft:stone
> zpth watchnew minecraft:snowball s02 300 1 1091.5 -56 999 7
> item replace entity P weapon.mainhand with minecraft:snowball
> tp P 1091.5 -57 994.5 0 0
> zpth use P
sleep 3
> item replace entity P weapon.mainhand with minecraft:snowball
> tp P 1091.5 -57 995.5 0 0
> zpth use P
sleep 3
> item replace entity P weapon.mainhand with minecraft:snowball
> tp P 1091.5 -57 996.2 0 0
> zpth use P
sleep 3
> zpth watchnew minecraft:ender_pearl p02 200 1 1091.5 -56 999 7
> item replace entity P weapon.mainhand with minecraft:ender_pearl
> tp P 1091.5 -57 995.5 0 0
> zpth use P
sleep 4
> zpth player P
> zpth count s02
> zpth count p02
expect \[zpth\] count s02 n=0
expect \[zpth\] count p02 n=0
