## CQ-PS15B-02
@group client
@commands Client toml `[surface.wthit] passThrough = false` saved with `sed -i`, then the client-side reload of `/cdevreload compat`
@pass the Walk Through lines go at once after the reload
@fails client command routing to `CompatConfigReload.reload`
@draft `/cdevreloadclient compat` is a client command: the capture driver's cmd step runs commands on the integrated server, so the batch cannot send it (needs a driver step for client commands, or the owner types it)
